    LLM: '1. Stock: Click the stock to deal one card at a time to the waste pile.\n2. Re-Deals: NO re-deals are allowed. Once the stock is empty, the game ends if no more moves remain.\n3. Foundations: Build from Ace, 2, 3... King by suit.',
    Player: '1. Stock: Click the stock to deal one card at a time to the waste pile.\n2. Re-Deals: NO re-deals are allowed. Once the stock is empty, the game ends if no more moves remain.\n3. Foundations: Build from Ace, 2, 3... King by suit.',
    objective: 'Move all 104 cards into the 8 foundation piles, building each from Ace up to King by suit.',
    gameplay: '1. Stock: Click the stock to deal one card at a time to the waste pile.\n2. Re-Deals: NO re-deals are allowed. Once the stock is empty, the game ends if no more moves remain.\n3. Foundations: Build from Ace, 2, 3... King by suit.',
    keyRules: [
      'Single Move Only: The inability to move stacks/sequences makes the preservation of empty columns the most vital part of the game.',
      'Face-Up: Since matches are by suit and rank, you are rarely searching for hidden information, but rather calculating complex sequences of moves.',
